{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-candace-aster","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"candace-aster-azizi-developments-al-furjan","about":"Candace Aster is a residential project by Azizi Developments in Al Furjan, Dubai. The development consists of elegantly designed studios and 1 -2 bedroom apartments and offers comfortable living with a wide range of amenities, 24-hour concierge and luxurious living environment. It offers residents fully furnished apartments using high quality materials, exquisite amenities and European bathroom fixtures from the world's leading manufacturers. To create a comfortable atmosphere, residents are provided with a variety of amenities, including residence maintenance, housekeeping, laundry, valet parking service and childcare. Residents also have access to daily luxury amenities including a swimming pool, gym, spa, and outdoor Jacuzzi. There is a secure playground for children. One designated parking space is provided for each residential unit at the basement level.The complex is located close to Sheikh Mohammed Ben Zayed Street, which leads to the emirate's famous developments.Al Furjan Pavilion and Al Furjan West Pavilion, two community centers in the area, offer a wide range of amenities such as retail stores, restaurants, sports facilities, swimming pools, cafes and more.The on-site Candace Restaurant expands the dining options. Just 20 minutes' drive to Al Maktoum International Airport, 35 minutes' drive to Dubai International Airport.","price":1707960,"title":"Candace Aster","bitrix":{"id":597,"pf_id":"are.3.8300","source":null,"project_id":"Azizi Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azizi Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1711/images/2024/04/24/340x252/FHQTTh9jfvRg4deIiMVooDxBqO4ndaywi8h3PC